#: e08266d7aced4fd59da7ad9dc8424a80
msgid ""
"Aligns onto a common time grid through `align_timeseries_collection()`; "
"exact axis equality is not required when alignment succeeds."
msgstr ""
"`align_timeseries_collection()` によって共通の時間グリッドに整列します。整列が成功すれば、軸の厳密な一致は不要です。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/reference/gwpy_added_api.md
#: 391d73cf68644f738a74fae224dd19c0
msgid ""
"`align=\"intersection\"` default; forwards alignment kwargs (including "
"`method` and `tolerance`) to the alignment helper."
msgstr ""
"既定は `align=\"intersection\"`。整列用のキーワード引数（`method` や `tolerance` "
"を含む）を整列ヘルパーに転送します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/reference/gwpy_added_api.md
#: 83945a6316a84f678a4e6d16988b6b1a
msgid ""
"Source `TimeSeries.unit` is not carried into per-cell matrix metadata by "
"this conversion path; reconstructed elements are dimensionless unless "
"metadata is set separately."
msgstr ""
"この変換経路では、元の `TimeSeries.unit` "
"はセル単位の行列メタデータに引き継がれません。メタデータを別途設定しない限り、復元された要素は無次元になります。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/reference/gwpy_added_api.md
#: c03cc0d118e547d2b4384cd6d516ccee
msgid ""
"Dict keys are written into element names; generated row keys (`row0`, "
"`row1`, ...) are used for round-trip dict keys."
msgstr "辞書のキーは要素名に書き込まれます。往復変換の辞書キーには、生成された行キー（`row0`、`row1`、…）が使われます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/reference/gwpy_added_api.md
#: b4809c948620441e83714aed7dc2c880
msgid "`FrequencySeries`"
msgstr ""

